{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】土木工程拓展署聯同運輸署及警方今日(11月27日)介紹中九龍繞道九龍灣段開通詳情。另外，香港繽紛冬日巡禮之冬日小鎮銅鑼灣亮燈，並有光影表演。</p><p>採訪日誌｜中九龍繞道九龍灣段開通詳情／冬日小鎮銅鑼灣亮燈</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T23:44:17.982427+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:23:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:49.342565+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:37:49.342565+00:00","content_hash":"fe4ab35a7b7aa1fdad8646c1cad8a23a2f41d018201d8091cc68d323223231b8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}